Table full name: bigquery-public-data.sdoh_bea_cainc30.fips
Column name: Year Type: DATE Description: FIPS Year
Column name: GeoFIPS Type: STRING Description: US County Geoids
Column name: GeoName Type: STRING Description: US County Geoids Description
Column name: Employer_contrib_pension_and_insurance Type: INT64 Description: Thousands of dollars;Includes actual employer contributions and actuarially imputed employer contributions to reflect benefits accrued by defined benefit pension plan participants through service to employers in the current period.
Column name: Employer_contrib_govt_and_social_insurance Type: INT64 Description: Thousands of dollars
Column name: Farm_proprietors_income Type: INT64 Description: Thousands of dollars
Column name: Nonfarm_proprietors_income Type: INT64 Description: Thousands of dollars
Column name: Farm_proprietors_employment Type: INT64 Description: Number of jobs; Excludes limited partners.
Column name: Income_maintenance_benefits Type: INT64 Description: Thousands of dollars; Consists largely of Supplemental Security Income (SSI) payments; Earned Income Tax Credits (EITC); family assistance; general assistance; expenditures for food under the Special Supplemental Nutrition Program for Women, Infants, and Children (WIC); Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program (SNAP); and other assistance benefits.
Column name: Nonfarm_proprietors_employment Type: INT64 Description: Number of jobs
